Package: MutGlyph
Title: Interactive Cancer Genomics Plots
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kari", "Lavikka", , "kari@karilavikka.fi", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Creates opinionated, interactive cancer genomics plots from
    'maftools' mutation data and ordinary mutation tables, including oncoplots,
    protein lollipop plots, and rainfall plots. 'GenomeSpy' provides
    browser-based rendering, exploration, and publication-quality vector
    export. Familiar 'maftools' conventions are retained where practical so
    that common calls require minimal changes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/HautaniemiLab/MutGlyph,
    https://genomespy.app/MutGlyph/
BugReports: https://github.com/HautaniemiLab/MutGlyph/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    htmlwidgets,
    jsonlite,
    maftools
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
